=== entry 2e5198f422d5
kind: translation
rules: webhook
intent: T3 checks an HMAC-SHA256 signature of the raw body instead of bearer and `X-Automation-Key` headers. Signing the exact bytes sent keeps the check from failing on reserialized JSON. Preserve the JSON body, the 8-second timeout, and the single try.
--- upstream
- method `POST`
- `Content-Type: application/json`
- `Authorization: Bearer <key>`
- `X-Automation-Key: <key>`
- body: one JSON object with the fields named in the routine prompt
- timeout: 8 seconds
- one try, no retry
--- patched
- method `POST`
- `Content-Type: application/json`
- `x-signature-256: sha256=<hex>`, the HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body, keyed with the text of `webhook-secret`. Sign the exact bytes you send.
- body: one JSON object with the fields named in the task prompt
- timeout: 8 seconds
- one try, no retry

